      "responseContract": "appcall-provider-json-v1",
      "adaptations": [
        "Credential-only healthcheck maps to GET /datatables/SHARADAR/TICKERS/metadata.json rather than the pinned billable ticker data query.",
        "api_key is sent as the documented query parameter. X-Api-Token is also sent to match pinned source.",
        "HTTP 200 bodies with a quandl_error object fail via bodyErrorPaths. Native returns raw JSON under data rather than the upstream normalized metadata wrapper. Native category is banking-data (source Finance/Data are not in Rust CATEGORIES). The upstream user-agent is not sent."
      ]
